WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.930
- So a young woman allegedly
put Gorilla Glue in her hair

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.620
and may sue the manufacturer.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.360
- When I do my hair, I like to, you know,

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.620
finish it off with a
little Got2b Glued spray.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.860
Well, I didn't have any
more Got2b Glued spray,

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.240
so I used this.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.670
- Does she have a claim?

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.020
Well, in America you can sue anyone

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.650
for anything at any time.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.170
So you can file a lawsuit, it
doesn't mean that you'll win.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.350
But, in terms of product liability,

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.610
it all comes down to the warning.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.640
Number one, you don't have
a duty to warn about things

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.090
that aren't reasonably foreseeable.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.550
Was it reasonably foreseeable that someone

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.150
would put this glue in their hair?

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.120
Maybe, maybe not.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.270
Probably not.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.950
Number two, if you get over that hurdle,

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.090
then you have to test the
sufficiency of the warning.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.880
Was the warning that was given sufficient?

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.010
And, here, the Gorilla
Glue said specifically

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.170
don't bring it in contact with
skin and other body parts.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:43.220
That's probably going to be sufficient.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.530
But, again, you can file a suit,

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:45.940
it doesn't mean you're going to win.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.890
But, come on, you already knew that.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:48.840
And here's some more advice:

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.273
subscribe or I will see you in court.

